infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title Length = precision: each extra char shrinks the cell ~32x
  desc A longer geohash narrows the cell, so a shared prefix pins points closer together
  sequences
    - label 4 chars
      desc Cell ~40 km — a metro region
    - label 5 chars
      desc Cell ~5 km — a district
    - label 6 chars
      desc Cell ~1 km — a neighbourhood
    - label 7 chars
      desc Cell ~150 m — a city block
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
